{
  "area": "models",
  "description": "Which draft pairs with a model. `familyDraftFor` and `skipReason` take a header object (missing keys read as null, false or 0) and, for skipReason, a size in bytes. `planDraft` takes files that the runner creates in a temp dir: `hex` is the leading bytes, `size` the length (extended with zeros); `model` names one of them. Expected is the plan {family, url, filename} or null. The download itself is not part of this area.",
